X86 AC+xchg
"Expected: Forbidden. Source: derivation (the locked XCHG drains the store of x). x86 analogue of AC+dmb.st+ldadd+dmb.ld. UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
{ x=0; s=0; }
 P0           | P1          ;
 MOV [x],$1   | MOV EAX,[s] ;
 MOV EAX,$1   | MOV EBX,[x] ;
 XCHG [s],EAX |             ;
exists (1:EAX=1 /\ 1:EBX=0)
